@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userToken = paste-a-user-token-here
@deviceToken = paste-site-1-device-token-here
@currentPassword = Solar#Demo2026
@newPassword = Brighter#Sun2027
@readingTimestamp = {{$datetime iso8601}}

### Public health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs
Accept: text/html

### Uniform 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported method (405; Allow: GET)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/health

### Unacceptable representation (406)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: text/html

### Unsupported write Content-Type (415)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/unimplemented
Content-Type: text/plain

example

### Malformed JSON (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/unimplemented
Content-Type: application/json

{"invalid":

### Login national operator (Swagger lists all seven demo emails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"national.operator@slsea.lk","password":"{{currentPassword}}"}

### Own profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Manageable users
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users?sort=name&page_size=2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Hierarchy and scoped collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/provinces/1/districts
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Installation overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/installations/1/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Regional summary (scope comes from the caller)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/generation-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### History; copy its ETag to the conditional request below
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/installations/1/readings?page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Conditional history (replace placeholder with the returned ETag)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/installations/1/readings?page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
If-None-Match: "paste-returned-etag"

### Trend (adjust dates to your seeded window)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/generation-trend?from=2026-10-08T18:30:00Z&to=2026-10-09T18:30:00Z&interval=day
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Device ingest: set counter >= the predecessor's counter before sending
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/installations/1/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"timestamp":"{{readingTimestamp}}","power_Kw":1,"cumulative_energy_Kwh":10000,"voltage":230}

### Self-change: revokes userToken; log in with newPassword afterward
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"current_password":"{{currentPassword}}","new_password":"{{newPassword}}"}

### Higher-jurisdiction reset (site-independent user ID; national user can reset user 3)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"new_password":"{{newPassword}}"}
